 reported issues and shared feedback!Multiplayer ImprovementsFixed several synchronization issues that could prevent clients from interacting with customers.Improved customer queue synchronization between host and clients.Fixed issues with customers getting stuck or becoming unresponsive.Improved stability when joining or rejoining an ongoing multiplayer session.Fi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T16:58:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029587","verified_at":"2026-10-21T20:08:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5012960-1846651706694912","game_id":"steam-5012960","kind":"update","title":"Demo Hotfix – Day 2 Progression Fix","summary":"Hey Pawnbrokers!A small hotfix is now live!Fixed an issue where some players could get stuck on Day 2. Previously affected save files have also been recovered, so you can now continue your progress without starting over.Thank you for reporting the issue and helping improve Pawnshop Together! 💛— Luster Games","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T11:50:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694912","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:18:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5012960-1846651706689338","game_id":"steam-5012960","kind":"announcement","title":"🎉 2,000 Wishlists! Thank You for Your Incredible Support!","summary":"Hey Pawnbrokers!Pawnshop Together has officially reached 2,000 wishlists on Steam! 🎉Just a short time after celebrating 1,000 wishlists, we've already doubled that number!As a solo developer, it's incredible to see so many people discovering and enjoying Pawnshop Together.A huge thank you to everyone who has wishlisted the game, played the demo, shared their feedback, or helped spread the word. Your support means so much to me and keeps me motivated to make the game even better!We're just gettin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T09:00:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689338","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:18:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5012960-1846651706688060","game_id":"steam-5012960","kind":"announcement","title":"🎉 1,000 Wishlists! Thank You for Your Support!","summary":"Hey Pawnbrokers!Pawnshop Together has officially reached 1,000 wishlists on Steam! 🎉As a solo developer, seeing so many people interested in my game means the world to me.Thank you to everyone who has wishlisted the game, played the demo, shared feedback, or simply supported the project. Every bit of support motivates me to keep improving Pawnshop Together!And this is just the beginning! 💛If you haven't tried it yet, the free demo is available now on Steam. Grab some friends and start your own p","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T21:22:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688060","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:18:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5012960-1846651706685543","game_id":"steam-5012960","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update #2 – Punching, Furniture Selling & More!","summary":"Demo Update #2 Hey Pawnbrokers! 👋We're back with another demo update! This time, we're bringing some fun new mechanics, a cleaner HUD, improvements to the building system, and plenty of bug fixes.Let's take a look at what's new!🆕 New FeaturesPunching Mechanic: Things can get a little chaotic now! You can punch NPCs with your fists or knock them down by riding into them with your bicycle.Furniture Selling: Bought something you no longer need? You c